{"id":"00b78970-9fb2-4a9d-8cee-36e8473055cd","title":"Shifted Swirls 7","slug":"shifted-swirls-7","collectionSlug":"shifted-swirls","collectionName":"Shifted Swirls","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A warm, gradient-based shader effect featuring a radial gradient that transitions from pale cream (#fff2a8) at the center-left through vibrant orange (#ff7a1a) in the midtones to deep burgundy-brown (#3a0208) at the outer edges. The gradient radiates from the left side of the composition with an aspect ratio of 0.5, creating an elongated horizontal spread. Overlaid on this base are subtle ripple distortions emanating from the center-left, creating concentric wave patterns with a frequency of 8.3 that add visual texture and movement. A displacement map effect with 0.3 amount distorts the underlying gradient using the ripple pattern as a source, creating organic warping and undulation across the surface. The PixelThrow effect with 0.15 radius adds fine granular noise and luminance-based particle scattering, creating a slightly grainy, atmospheric quality. The overall effect is warm, organic, and fluid with soft transitions between color zones. The tone mapping uses ACES, enhancing the richness and depth of the warm color palette. The composition has a glowing, almost liquid quality with gentle distortions that suggest movement and depth.","colors":["#fff2a8","#ff7a1a","#3a0208","#ffffff"],"labels":["gradient","glowing","organic","calm"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/00b78970-9fb2-4a9d-8cee-36e8473055cd.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"Ripples","id":"idmsx81sj7r8hp63y3d","_key":"key_msx81sj7r8hp63y3d","props":{"phase":0,"speed":1,"center":{"x":0,"y":0.5},"colorA":"#ffffff","colorB":"#000000","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","softness":1.1,"blendMode":"normal","frequency":8.3,"thickness":0.5,"transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0}}},{"type":"RadialGradient","id":"idmsx7y